\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4.415066756285483</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2.7409234201935376</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.1595099</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[67]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{check} & \\text{relative residual / time}\\\\\\hline\\text{L = 4: vector t₁ vs matrix (G\\_c)} & 2.2150840950639034\\times 10^{-16}\\\\\\hline\\text{L = 4: vector t₃ vs quantum-minor t₃ (G\\_c)} & 2.2812803655462956\\times 10^{-16}\\\\\\hline\\text{L = 6: [t₁(0.37), t₃(−6/5)] $\\psi$ (G\\_c)} & 3.720787869869746\\times 10^{-16}\\\\\\hline\\text{L = 6: [t₃(0.41), t₃(−6/5)] $\\psi$ (G\\_c)} & 4.415066756285483\\times 10^{-16}\\\\\\hline\\text{L = 6: [t₁, t₃] $\\psi$, untwisted homogeneous} & 2.7409234201935376\\times 10^{-16}\\\\\\hline\\text{L = 6: seconds per t₃ application} & 0.1595099\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "f9a2f009-f447-4fd1-b803-eabf4e0aad9f"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Summary (2026-10-12)\n\n- **Dual Lax [exact]:** t₃(u) = ∏_s g_s(u) · tr[ℒ̄₁(u)⋯ℒ̄_L(u) · det G · G^{−T}], with ℒ̄_A = (u−θ+h) − hP, g_A = (u−θ−h)(u−θ−2h); ℒ̄_F = (u−θ−3h) + hK, g_F = (u−θ)(u−θ−h). Same Lax form as the fundamental one with ρ → ρ* (A ↔ F roles) and shifts θ̄_A = θ−h, θ̄_F = θ+3h. Derived site by site from the quantum minors (symbolic), checked on the chain at L = 2, 4 for four twists.\n- **Why the naive try failed:** same θ on both site types; adding the relative shift 4h alone fixes commutation (untwisted and G_c).\n- **Vector form [numeric, 10⁻¹⁶]:** one pass per vector, 0.16 s per application at L = 6 sites (4096-dim); [t₁, t₃] = [t₃, t₃] = 0 there, twisted inhomogeneous and untwisted homogeneous. Ready for the L = 3 pairs on-shell states (degenerate-state resolution in `abjm_bridges.py`).\n- For eigenvectors the prefactor ∏g_s is irrelevant; t̄₃ alone can be used (it is non-degenerate as a generating function where t₃ vanishes, e.g. at the g-zeros).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. t₂: fused ∧² Lax (6-dim auxiliary space)\n\nSame route as for t₃. One-site 2×2 quantum minors M_{I,J}(u) = qmin_{I,J}[ℒ](u), I, J ∈ 2-subsets (aux basis e_I = e_{i₁}∧e_{i₂}). Ansatz after removing the common scalar g(u):\n\nM/g = (u − θ + κh)·1 + σ h Σ_{ab} D(e_ab) ⊗ ρ(E_ab),\n\nwhere D(X) is X acting as a derivation on ∧²𝐂⁴ (the ∧² image of the fundamental Lax Σ e_ab ⊗ ρ(E_ab)). Solve for κ, σ identically in u, θ, h.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "subs2 = Subsets[Range[nn], {2}];\nqmin2Site[rho_, Ir_, Jc_] := Sum[Signature[p] laxE[rho][u, Ir[[p[[1]]]], Jc[[1]]] . laxE[rho][u - h, Ir[[p[[2]]]], Jc[[2]]], {p, Permutations[{1, 2}]}];\nwedgeC[k_, m_, Ir_] := Which[{k, m} == Ir, 1, {m, k} == Ir, -1, True, 0];\nDw[X_] := Table[Sum[X[[k, Jc[[1]]]] wedgeC[k, Jc[[2]], Ir] + X[[k, Jc[[2]]]] wedgeC[Jc[[1]], k, Ir], {k, nn}], {Ir, subs2}, {Jc, subs2}];\nDwE = Table[Dw[Normal[ee[a, b]]], {a, nn}, {b, nn}];\nwedgeAnsatz[rho_, kap_, sg_] := Table[(u - th + kap h) KroneckerDelta[iI, iJ] IdentityMatrix[nn] + sg h Sum[DwE[[a, b, iI, iJ]] Normal[rho[a, b]], {a, nn}, {b, nn}], {iI, 6}, {iJ, 6}];\n(* g from the polynomial gcd of all entries; overall normalisation lam free *)\nwedgeFit[rho_] := Module[{M = Table[Expand[qmin2Site[rho, subs2[[iI]], subs2[[iJ]]]], {iI, 6}, {iJ, 6}], g, sol},\n   g = Factor[PolynomialGCD @@ DeleteCases[Flatten[M], 0]];\n   sol = SolveAlways[Thread[Flatten[Together[M/g] - lam wedgeAnsatz[rho, kap, sg]] == 0], {u, th, h}];\n   {Factor[lam g /. First[sol]], {kap, sg} /. First[sol]}];\nwedgeFits = {{\"A\", Sequence @@ wedgeFit[rhoA]}, {\"F\", Sequence @@ wedgeFit[rhoF]}};\nGrid[Prepend[wedgeFits, {\"site\", \"g(u)  (M = g · Lax)\", \"{κ, σ}:  Lax = (u−θ+κh) + σh Σ D(e_ab)⊗ρ(E_ab)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"22\" data-out-n=\"275\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"12\" data-sub-start=\"12\" data-sub-end=\"12\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[275]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">A</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g(u) (M = g </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> Lax)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">th</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">th</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mord\">, </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord\">}: Lax = (u−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mord\">h) + </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord\">h Σ D(e_ab)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\">(E_ab)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[275]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{site} & \\text{g(u)  (M = g $\\cdot$ Lax)} & \\text{\\{$\\kappa$, $\\sigma$\\}:  Lax = (u−$\\theta$+$\\kappa$h) + $\\sigma$h $\\Sigma$ D(e\\_ab)$\\otimes$$\\rho$(E\\_ab)}\\\\\\hline\\text{A} & -h-\\mathrm{th}+u & \\left\\{0,1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{F} & u-\\mathrm{th} & \\left\\{-1,1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "a042d973-fbca-4208-b279-c1873b410b91"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 3 [exact, symbolic].** M_{I,J} = g_s(u) · ℒ⁽²⁾_s(u)_{IJ} with ℒ⁽²⁾ = Σ e_IJ ⊗ ((u − θ̃_s)δ_IJ + h Σ_ab D(e_ab)_{IJ} ρ_s(E_ab)) — the fundamental Lax lifted to ∧² (D = derivation action on ∧²𝐂⁴), no sign gauge needed:\n\n- A site: g_A = u−θ−h, θ̃_A = θ;\n- F site: g_F = u−θ, θ̃_F = θ + h.\n\nRelative A/F shift h (for t₃ it was 4h; for t₁ it is 0).\n\n### Chain: t₂(u) = ∏_s g_s(u) · tr[ℒ⁽²⁾₁(u)⋯ℒ⁽²⁾_L(u) · ∧²G],  (∧²G)_{JI} = det G_{J,I}\n\nExact check against the quantum-minor t₂ at L = 2, 4 sites, four twists, two u values; then the one-pass vector form against the matrix at L = 4.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wedgeOp[ty_][iI_, iJ_] := wedgeOp[ty][iI, iJ] = Sum[DwE[[a, b, iI, iJ]] If[ty == \"A\", rhoA[a, b], rhoF[a, b]], {a, nn}, {b, nn}];\nwedgeE[\"A\"][v_, t_][iI_, iJ_] := (v - t) KroneckerDelta[iI, iJ] id4 + hh wedgeOp[\"A\"][iI, iJ];\nwedgeE[\"F\"][v_, t_][iI_, iJ_] := (v - t - hh) KroneckerDelta[iI, iJ] id4 + hh wedgeOp[\"F\"][iI, iJ];\ngW[\"A\"][v_, t_] := v - t - hh; gW[\"F\"][v_, t_] := v - t;\nGw[G_] := Table[Det[G[[subs2[[jJ]], subs2[[iI]]]]], {jJ, 6}, {iI, 6}];\nmonoTd[ent_, types_, ths_, v_, d_] := Module[{L = Length[types], T},\n   T = Table[siteOp[1, ent[types[[1]]][v, ths[[1]]][i, j], L], {i, d}, {j, d}];\n   Do[T = Table[Sum[T[[i, k]] . siteOp[s, ent[types[[s]]][v, ths[[s]]][k, j], L], {k, d}], {i, d}, {j, d}], {s, 2, L}]; T];\nt2wedge[types_, ths_, G_, v_] := Module[{T = monoTd[wedgeE, types, ths, v, 6], W = Gw[G]},\n   (Times @@ MapThread[gW[#1][v, #2] &, {types, ths}]) Sum[T[[iI, jJ]] W[[jJ, iI]], {iI, 6}, {jJ, 6}]];\nchain2Rows = Flatten[Table[With[{types = Take[{\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"}, L], ths = Take[th4, L]},\n     {L, tw[[1]], zeroQ[tQM[2, types, ths, tw[[2]], 37/100] - t2wedge[types, ths, tw[[2]], 37/100]], zeroQ[tQM[2, types, ths, tw[[2]], -6/5] - t2wedge[types, ths, tw[[2]], -6/5]]}],\n    {L, {2, 4}}, {tw, twists}], 1];\n(* one-pass vector form, aux dimension d *)\ntransferVecD[ent_, types_, ths_, G_, v_, psi_, d_] := Module[{L = Length[types], Phi, mat},\n   mat[s_, i_, j_] := N[Normal[ent[types[[s]]][v, ths[[s]]][i, j]]];\n   Phi = Table[applySite[psi, L, mat[L, k, j], L], {k, d}, {j, d}];\n   Do[Phi = Table[Sum[applySite[Phi[[m, j]], s, mat[s, k, m], L], {m, d}], {k, d}, {j, d}], {s, L - 1, 1, -1}];\n   Sum[Phi[[i, j]] G[[j, i]], {i, d}, {j, d}]];\nt2Vec[types_, ths_, G_, v_, psi_] := N[Times @@ MapThread[gW[#1][v, #2] &, {types, ths}]] transferVecD[wedgeE, types, ths, N[Gw[G]], v, psi, 6];\nvec2Res = relRes[N[tQM[2, types4, th4, Gc[zz], 37/100]] . psi4, t2Vec[types4, th4, Gc[zz], 37/100, psi4]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"L sites\", \"twist\", \"t₂ = ∏g·tr[T⁽²⁾ ∧²G] at u = 37/100\", \"at u = −6/5\"}}, chain2Rows,\n   {{\"L = 4\", \"G_c(z)\", \"vector t₂ vs quantum-minor t₂, rel. residual\", ScientificForm[vec2Res, 2]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
